                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce6f665a-65a3-3de2-aca5-74f98e2ed47f",
                        "entry_id": "36fb5e74-05c5-373f-bac2-fc5c3779a5c8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн. машина для просеивания сыпучих материалов через сито, натянутое на вращающемся барабане"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "828c691d-af75-4ad0-9ee1-a8189690d3d0",
                                "sense_id": "ce6f665a-65a3-3de2-aca5-74f98e2ed47f",
                                "text": "Перед применением сахар просеивают в буратах через сита с отверстиями диаметром не более 3 мм и пропускают через магниты для очистки от металлических примесей."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "181eec4f-f6cd-4219-9965-1fe5f2520d45",
                        "source_entry_id": "36fb5e74-05c5-373f-bac2-fc5c3779a5c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce6f665a-65a3-3de2-aca5-74f98e2ed47f",
                        "target_lang_word": "reel",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "reel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a26f800-32ed-316e-bd74-54edbe020b31",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b3d517-31ba-36ee-9f67-570f66e280da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shaky or unsteady gait."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cebab45a-dcbf-4a44-a2c6-395bbe586aad",
                                                "sense_id": "8a26f800-32ed-316e-bd74-54edbe020b31",
                                                "text": "Doubtless the present game of chess was developed through just such fiddling; perhaps someone once thought that the drunken reel of the knight was hostile to the essence of Chess."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d41060f-f4f5-3c46-bc0e-fc100aa81efa",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b3d517-31ba-36ee-9f67-570f66e280da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lively dance originating in Scotland."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5412097c-1ed3-4d3f-b362-1db7b6b90cb0",
                                                "sense_id": "1d41060f-f4f5-3c46-bc0e-fc100aa81efa",
                                                "text": "So strict is the kirk of Scotland, that one minister was unfrocked for writing a play (in former times); and another was sent about his business for being too fond of whiskey and of dancing the reel of Tullochgorum."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05038e13-f2c9-39a4-94dd-87941c96fa37",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b3d517-31ba-36ee-9f67-570f66e280da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The music of this dance; often called a Scottish (or Scotch) reel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f56ce486-3b08-4c44-a451-25096109427e",
                                                "sense_id": "05038e13-f2c9-39a4-94dd-87941c96fa37",
                                                "text": "[…]sample the famed waters from the Scottish mountains like a native born, and last but not least, play a reel on the bagpipes in the big hall that set all the laddies and lassies dancing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "207f75d2-b36c-460f-91dc-790403c90fa4",
                                                "sense_id": "05038e13-f2c9-39a4-94dd-87941c96fa37",
                                                "text": "The traditional reel Within a Mile of Dublin, for instance, distorts until it reaches something quasi-industrial."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1bd65ff-579b-349a-971c-8118c9acbe3c",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b3d517-31ba-36ee-9f67-570f66e280da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A kind of spool, turning on an axis, on which yarn, threads, lines, or the like, are wound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9ebf4d0-612e-45fa-bb9f-70806ea6de61",
                                                "sense_id": "e1bd65ff-579b-349a-971c-8118c9acbe3c",
                                                "text": "a log reel"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50179ddb-5704-4f85-b519-5cc477b0ad80",
                                                "sense_id": "e1bd65ff-579b-349a-971c-8118c9acbe3c",
                                                "text": "an angler's reel"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "684e76c9-c5d2-4ffe-b24c-9c95fb59c2b2",
                                                "sense_id": "e1bd65ff-579b-349a-971c-8118c9acbe3c",
                                                "text": "a garden reel"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e092746a-737d-490d-9878-2fe692183ec5",
                                                "sense_id": "e1bd65ff-579b-349a-971c-8118c9acbe3c",
                                                "text": "Nudge the fruit machine reel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cb06c64-8b76-45ef-8ec2-bfb12143e248",
                                                "sense_id": "e1bd65ff-579b-349a-971c-8118c9acbe3c",
                                                "text": "A hose reel forms part of a hose trolley or hose cart"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41f56132-e845-38f2-a585-229ed558d059",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b3d517-31ba-36ee-9f67-570f66e280da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device consisting of radial arms with horizontal stats, connected with a harvesting machine, for holding the stalks of grain in position to be cut by the knives."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc04d036-0617-3825-9f7b-59ba781605ba",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b3d517-31ba-36ee-9f67-570f66e280da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short compilation of sample film work used as a demonstrative resume in the entertainment industry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdf2cd0c-75a2-3e3e-86db-5fa8a30e9ffd",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b3d517-31ba-36ee-9f67-570f66e280da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chronological collection of pictures or short videos published by a user on an app or website and typically only available for a short period."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "capitalized",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "reel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e3e6926-1cf1-39fa-b036-b6a2df17fe5b",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To wind on a reel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31cefe0d-8478-370c-802d-ac0e55d3bbf2",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To spin or revolve repeatedly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f1ec514-b767-3134-82d6-df202b121225",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To unwind; to bring or acquire something by spinning or winding something else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fd0111b-77c0-443c-a416-54c8525ca35d",
                                                "sense_id": "9f1ec514-b767-3134-82d6-df202b121225",
                                                "text": "He reeled off some tape from the roll and sealed the package."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1157a218-7851-3fae-84ed-d1e48e56d457",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To walk shakily or unsteadily; to stagger; move as if drunk or not in control of oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74ce6d63-e41e-4e1b-a4cc-ddfeeaf8d84e",
                                                "sense_id": "1157a218-7851-3fae-84ed-d1e48e56d457",
                                                "text": "They reel to and fro, and stagger like a drunken man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c4c5a92-315d-4ec4-b81d-5824b96a78a9",
                                                "sense_id": "1157a218-7851-3fae-84ed-d1e48e56d457",
                                                "text": "He, with heavy fumes oppress'd, / Reel'd from the palace, and retired to rest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f333eeab-0808-46ba-bc53-ec1ece2d5a77",
                                                "sense_id": "1157a218-7851-3fae-84ed-d1e48e56d457",
                                                "text": "the wagons reeling under the yellow sheaves"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96375568-06e7-4b47-9d43-be99471adbac",
                                                "sense_id": "1157a218-7851-3fae-84ed-d1e48e56d457",
                                                "text": "It was by his order the shattered leading company flung itself into the houses when the Sin Verguenza were met by an enfilading volley as they reeled into the calle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd52f6aa-71df-4eac-810d-d34184842181",
                                                "sense_id": "1157a218-7851-3fae-84ed-d1e48e56d457",
                                                "text": "Sarah reels a little, nevertheless, under the dog's boisterous greeting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17d57ea0-6f0c-4257-a948-1863d9d509f8",
                                                "sense_id": "1157a218-7851-3fae-84ed-d1e48e56d457",
                                                "text": "Wheeler reels with fright. He almost falls off the front of the stage. His stomach convulses and he wants to vomit, but a frantic fragment of his brain hasn't panicked yet and tells him, Wait. Nothing's changed. That's what humans have always looked like. Right? What's happening? What's wrong?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfafd162-d1f6-3fc6-83bd-9e49a0bd8808",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To back off, step away, or sway backwards unsteadily and suddenly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "with back"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f634b2ed-112e-4f90-8a4c-0b92f80d70c5",
                                                "sense_id": "dfafd162-d1f6-3fc6-83bd-9e49a0bd8808",
                                                "text": "He reeled back from the punch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d91b3096-085c-4a90-b5c0-e0da513b17b3",
                                                "sense_id": "dfafd162-d1f6-3fc6-83bd-9e49a0bd8808",
                                                "text": "Terry's fist lashed out, but Simpson, anticipating the blow, stepped quickly to one side. Another followed, however, and caught the older man fairly on the chin, sent him reeling back."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d66e62e-600a-3c1a-87f9-c56e5fa11dbb",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make or cause to reel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bad164a2-49bd-3e41-bb00-bcf9d8fdafc4",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To have a whirling sensation; to be giddy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f176345-b328-4a7b-bdcf-ff5541acf9a3",
                                                "sense_id": "bad164a2-49bd-3e41-bb00-bcf9d8fdafc4",
                                                "text": "In these lengthened vigils his brain often reeled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "887e9930-12e0-46c6-9163-87cc69814d42",
                                                "sense_id": "bad164a2-49bd-3e41-bb00-bcf9d8fdafc4",
                                                "text": "The high school had a send-off in my honour. It was an uncommon thing for a young man of Rajkot to go to England. I had written out a few words of thanks. But I could scarcely stammer them out. I remember how my head reeled and how my whole frame shook as I stood up to read them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "804efe97-3443-3276-9a2f-8436101fc9a5",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be in shock."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e9ff5ab-81c3-4711-982d-60a984afdfdb",
                                                "sense_id": "804efe97-3443-3276-9a2f-8436101fc9a5",
                                                "text": "New Jersey was reeling on Wednesday from the impact of Hurricane Sandy, which has caused catastrophic flooding here in Hoboken and in other New York City suburbs, destroyed entire neighborhoods across the state and wiped out iconic boardwalks in shore towns that had enchanted generations of vacationgoers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06ccac3e-fd02-3709-b735-08e995fce280",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To produce a mechanical insect-like song, as in grass warblers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c91bafa-7b00-3a47-8189-833fd8c7334f",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To roll."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78f7b7af-b00e-495c-89ce-a06820989a53",
                                                "sense_id": "2c91bafa-7b00-3a47-8189-833fd8c7334f",
                                                "text": "And Sisyphus an huge round stone did reele."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81e2eafc-f653-3718-b4f4-0096858e212d",
                                        "entry_id": "a76ccbba-fd92-3c4e-ab36-89eeb50fec73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bring in or along."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "085c733b-32ac-40d4-8b08-85cd7e38acfa",
                                                "sense_id": "81e2eafc-f653-3718-b4f4-0096858e212d",
                                                "text": "Frank stood at the sink, and began washing the plates. He realised if he was going to reel his great-aunt into his plan, he was going to have to do it very gently."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a2083d9e-3810-4636-8b64-b443371aa39f",
                        "source_entry_id": "36fb5e74-05c5-373f-bac2-fc5c3779a5c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce6f665a-65a3-3de2-aca5-74f98e2ed47f",
                        "target_lang_word": "Sichter",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Sichter",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c049ee8-28b8-3f15-ad32-801619ade20e",
                                        "entry_id": "d68bc0a4-1276-3e26-b7fb-2a7412b24504",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die etwas prüfend beobachtet oder begutachtet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c43d59e-a3f3-4af6-a79f-20ca3318fa2e",
                                                "sense_id": "7c049ee8-28b8-3f15-ad32-801619ade20e",
                                                "text": "„Immerhin werden nun Änderungen an einem Artikel der breiten Masse nicht mehr umgehend angezeigt, dies bedarf der Zustimmung eines ‚Sichters‘.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2895b554-09e0-481c-8005-b4970eff876c",
                                                "sense_id": "7c049ee8-28b8-3f15-ad32-801619ade20e",
                                                "text": "„Ihren Status erhalten die aktiven Sichter nach quantitativen Aktivitätskriterien und Wohlverhaltensvorschriften: So dürfen nur maximal drei Prozent der Bearbeitungen eines Benutzers wieder rückgängig gemacht worden sein.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9655f473-6245-416a-8fed-caf9b28c2a80",
                                                "sense_id": "7c049ee8-28b8-3f15-ad32-801619ade20e",
                                                "text": "„Durch die Nutzergruppe der Sichter wurde eine Zwischeninstanz geschaffen; die Sichtung eines Artikels bestätigt die Überprüfung auf offensichtlichen Vandalismus durch einen regelmäßigen Autor der Wikipedia, sagt jedoch nichts über die inhaltliche Qualität oder Richtigkeit eines Artikels aus.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cc6f89f-4c49-450d-942d-88d9bee23169",
